-- create_dir_all
tree/a/b/c exists: true
a second time is no error
slashes at the end are ignored: true
over a file: AlreadyExists
under a file: NotADirectory
of nothing: InvalidInput
-- read_dir
a: a directory
file: a file
link-out: a symbolic link
link-to-file: a symbolic link
entries of tree/a/b/c: 1
of a missing directory: NotFound
of a file: NotADirectory
-- remove_dir_all
of a file: NotADirectory
of a missing path: NotFound
of a link to a directory: NotADirectory
the tree is gone: true
what the link pointed to is untouched
cleaned up
